menu "SolarYou sensor service"

config SOLARYOU_SIMULATION
    bool "Use adjustable Wokwi sensor backends"
    default n
    help
        Build the real sensor_adapter_* API with analog Wokwi inputs in
        place of the BNO085 and INA219 hardware interfaces. The four light
        inputs continue through the production light algorithm. Leave this
        disabled for physical hardware builds.

choice SOLARYOU_VALIDATION_MODE
    prompt "Sensor paths included in the validation application"
    default SOLARYOU_VALIDATION_ALL
    help
        Select which sensor path the standalone validation application owns.
        The normal physical build and combined Wokwi build use all sensors.
        The individual Wokwi builds compile and exercise only one path while
        preserving the same public sensor_adapter_* API.

config SOLARYOU_VALIDATION_ALL
    bool "IMU, light array, and power"

config SOLARYOU_VALIDATION_LIGHT_ONLY
    bool "Four-light array only"

config SOLARYOU_VALIDATION_IMU_ONLY
    bool "IMU only"

config SOLARYOU_VALIDATION_POWER_ONLY
    bool "Power sensor only"

endchoice

endmenu
